> This pet friendly hotel offers guests a deluxe breakfast each morning, free Wi-Fi, a business center, laundry facilities, and meeting space. This hotel is 15 minutes to the Atlanta Speedway, 3 miles to the Renaissance Festival.
Standard rooms feature free wireless internet access, cable TV with extra stations, free local calls, coffeemaker, microwave, mini-fridge and iron and board.
Guests will enjoy a deluxe breakfast each morning, as well as free Wi-Fi, use of the business center, laundry facilities, and a meeting space is available. Pets are welcome with additional charges.
Meeting space that[ can accommodate] up to 60 people theater style[ and] 30 people round table style are available on-site.

